# Environment configuration is app-local; the workspace root .env is not loaded.
# Backend secrets/database: apps/backend/api/.env.example -> apps/backend/api/.env
# Website settings: apps/web/site/.env.example -> apps/web/site/.env
# Dashboard public URL: apps/web/dash/.env.example -> apps/web/dash/.env
# Copy only when the destination does not exist. Keep Resend/admin secrets in the API.
